# Kubernetes NetworkPolicy cannot safely target private RDS without an approved
# egress strategy (security-group referencing, private CIDR allowlist, or
# equivalent). Do NOT enable open internet egress (all-zero IPv4 prefix).
#
# NetworkPolicy does not replace AWS security groups or RDS public-access=false.
#
# When platform provides an approved private CIDR or SG-aware CNI policy model,
# add an egress rule for TCP 5432 from api-gateway pods and activate via
# kustomization — never invent CIDRs in-repo.
